From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: incari-client <335801235+incari-client@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 18:50:36 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] modules: Hand the world's projection, bobbing and all, to the
 waypoint tags

The tags were projected with the camera's projection alone, while the world
is drawn with view bobbing, the hurt tilt and nausea's warp on top.

diff --git a/src/main/java/net/minecraft/client/renderer/GameRenderer.java b/src/main/java/net/minecraft/client/renderer/GameRenderer.java
index debb1be334cf7d1a15eebacd64d726b894156b56..25f807f27e314f66915b84ceacc8497be197254d 100644
--- a/src/main/java/net/minecraft/client/renderer/GameRenderer.java
+++ b/src/main/java/net/minecraft/client/renderer/GameRenderer.java
@@ -673,2 +673,5 @@
 
+        // Incari start: waypoint tags follow the world's bobbing, tilt and warp (ADR 0051)
+        incari.client.modules.ModuleHud.worldProjection(cameraState.projectionMatrix, projectionMatrix);
+        // Incari end
         RenderSystem.setProjectionMatrix(this.levelProjectionMatrixBuffer.getBuffer(projectionMatrix), ProjectionType.PERSPECTIVE);
